            <https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pgen.1007538>,
            <https://doi.org/10.7554/eLife.70253> .
    <https://doi.org/10.1038/ncomms6299> dct:title "Pigment cell interactions and differential xanthophore recruitment underlying zebrafish stripe reiteration and Danio pattern evolution" .
    <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41467-018-05629-z> dct:title "Iridophores as a source of robustness in zebrafish stripes and variability in Danio patterns" .
    <https://doi.org/10.1073/pnas.0808622106> dct:title "Interactions between zebrafish pigment cells responsible for the generation of Turing patterns" .
    <https://doi.org/10.1098/rstb.1952.0012> dct:title "The chemical basis of morphogenesis" .
    <https://doi.org/10.11646/zootaxa.1686.1.1> dct:title "The Celestial Pearl danio is a miniature Danio (s.s.)" .
    <https://doi.org/10.1242/dev.01526> dct:title "Pigment pattern evolution by differential deployment of neural crest and post-embryonic melanophore lineages in Danio fishes" .
    <https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pgen.1007538> dct:title "Evolution of Endothelin signaling and diversification of adult pigment pattern in Danio fishes" .
    <https://doi.org/10.7554/eLife.70253> dct:title "Development and genetics of red coloration in the zebrafish relative Danio albolineatus" .
}

